[agent:result] Create a table monitor.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Deprecated: Use Data Quality Monitors API instead
[agent:result]   (/api/data-quality/v1/monitors). Creates a new monitor for the specified
[agent:result]   table.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   The caller must either: 1. be an owner of the table's parent catalog, have
[agent:result]   **USE_SCHEMA** on the table's parent schema, and have **SELECT** access on the
[agent:result]   table 2. have **USE_CATALOG** on the table's parent catalog, be an owner of
[agent:result]   the table's parent schema, and have **SELECT** access on the table. 3. have
[agent:result]   the following permissions: - **USE_CATALOG** on the table's parent catalog -
[agent:result]   **USE_SCHEMA** on the table's parent schema - be an owner of the table.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Workspace assets, such as the dashboard, will be created in the workspace
[agent:result]   where this call was made.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   Arguments:
[agent:result]     TABLE_NAME: UC table name in format catalog.schema.table_name. This field
[agent:result]       corresponds to the {full_table_name_arg} arg in the endpoint path.
